WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.116
Was it true

00:00:00.928 --> 00:00:02.059
before anyone proved

00:00:01.871 --> 00:00:02.260
it

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.570
Around 300 BC

00:00:04.806 --> 00:00:05.773
Euclid proved the

00:00:05.585 --> 00:00:06.811
primes never end

00:00:07.047 --> 00:00:08.332
multiply any list

00:00:08.144 --> 00:00:08.992
of primes

00:00:09.205 --> 00:00:10.325
add one and

00:00:10.137 --> 00:00:11.221
a missing prime

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:12.082
must exist

00:00:12.622 --> 00:00:14.072
Empires and physical

00:00:13.884 --> 00:00:15.063
theories have fallen

00:00:14.874 --> 00:00:15.487
since

00:00:15.653 --> 00:00:16.454
but the proof

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:17.409
has never needed

00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:18.530
a single correction

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:19.812
So was it

00:00:19.624 --> 00:00:20.720
true before Euclid

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:21.732
If math is

00:00:21.544 --> 00:00:22.711
invented like chess

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:23.229
it should be

00:00:23.041 --> 00:00:24.126
ours to change

00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:24.857
If it is

00:00:24.669 --> 00:00:25.647
discovered like a

00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:26.213
continent

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:27.463
it existed before

00:00:27.275 --> 00:00:28.170
us and we

00:00:27.982 --> 00:00:29.303
must explain where

00:00:29.838 --> 00:00:30.852
Full story on

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:31.559
the dashboard
